{"ref":"BDB, מִלְכָּה","hw":"מִלְכָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִלְכָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.f.</strong> 𝔊 Μελχα <strong>(</strong> = <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכָּה</span>? Nö<sup>ZMG xlii. 1888, 484</sup> comp. Ph. n. pr. <em>deæ</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מלכת</span>; cf. Gray<sup>Prop. N. 116</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  wife of Nahor <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:29\" href=\"/Genesis.11.29\">Gn 11:29</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 22:20\" href=\"/Genesis.22.20\">22:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 22:23\" href=\"/Genesis.22.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:15\" href=\"/Genesis.24.15\">24:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:24\" href=\"/Genesis.24.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:47\" href=\"/Genesis.24.47\">47</a> (all J).<br><strong>2.</strong>  daughter of Zelophehad (of Manasseh), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:33\" href=\"/Numbers.26.33\">Nu 26:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:1\" href=\"/Numbers.27.1\">27:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 36:11\" href=\"/Numbers.36.11\">36:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:3\" href=\"/Joshua.17.3\">Jos 17:3</a> (all P).—Perhaps orig. town-name, Gray<sup>l.c.</sup>","next":"BDB, מְלוּכָה","prev":"BDB, מֹ֫לֶכֶת"}